$MDESC::Type = "CTF_HamstersMaps";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Avicord's Planet" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other with their massive flying bases. The bases are located 2 miles above the planet, if you fall then you might drop to your death. Win by scoring 10 points, you can do this by capturing the flag and holding a base on the planet surface, if you have survived the fall. May the best team win!" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Map By:<f4> Mike Hamlett (XGN Optimizer), with further modifications done by DSA*Enforcer, CAPKIRK, and Hamster_of_Doom!";
